{'symbol': 'CZR', 'date': '2021-06-04 08:00:00', 'title': "CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT, INC. COMPLETES PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED SALE OF TROPICANA EVANSVILLE TO GAMING & LEISURE PROPERTIES AND BALLY'S CORPORATION", 'text': 'LAS VEGAS AND RENO, NEV., JUNE 4, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CAESARS ENTERTAINMENT, INC. (NASDAQ: CZR) ("CAESARS") TODAY ANNOUNCED THE CLOSING OF THE SALE OF TROPICANA EVANSVILLE TO GAMING & LEISURE PROPERTIES AND BALLY\'S CORPORATION FOR AGGREGATE CONSIDERATION OF $480 MILLION IN CASH, SUBJECT TO A CUSTOMARY WORKING CAPITAL ADJUSTMENT.'}